Description: Implements random-projection maximum mean discrepancy methods for multivariate two-sample problems. Provides random projection utilities, Gaussian-kernel maximum mean discrepancy estimation, combined test statistics, permutation calibration, computational acceleration using Rcpp, and methods for summarizing and visualizing test results.
